\contentsline {section}{\numberline {8.1}Answers to the Research Questions}{103}{section.8.1}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{RQ1. Which discovery and rule treatment yields a sound, executable control-flow model that preserves the observed truck-visit behaviour, and do conformance metrics anticipate its behaviour in simulation?}{103}{section.8.1}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{RQ2. To what extent does the ProSiT simulation reproduce truck turnaround time and its response to load, and which components explain the discrepancies?}{104}{section.8.1}%
\contentsline {paragraph}{RQ3. To what extent can the simulation be used to evaluate a load-aware block allocation for deliveries, and what does it indicate about the effect on turnaround time?}{104}{section.8.1}%
